  "marineDataNeeds": "Real-time sea-water pH, total alkalinity, DIC & CO2 flux monitoring at release sites; basin-scale water quality MRV; ecosystem baseline and acidification quantification; long-term continuous ocean chem telemetry; standardized MRV protocols for credit verification",
